  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TRUST FUND FOR THE MONTREAL PROTOCOL ON SUBSTANCES THAT DEPLETE THE OZONE LAYER</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Montreal Protocol on Substances that Deplete the Ozone Layer is a global agreement to protect the Earth&#x2019;s ozone layer by phasing out the chemicals that deplete it. The Protocol provided a set of practical, actionable tasks that were universally agreed on. The Protocol has successfully met its objectives thus far and continues to safeguard the ozone layer today.</narrative>
  </description>
